{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:546d69223253edede373a6f7e8d3ed7f92554e5bfe548674023e6ba53aa95bbb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac21e5cc5637be94ea8cbdf2fafedc65b66d7e5c5304f31ec81cf3303e1ca6b",
      "text": "每天早晨的习惯",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554b64a07cea6a380c80d164e278beb7c95aec372832b4a79164b34a81fea732",
      "text": "制作人和朱雀为了拍摄，提前一天赶到了外景地。\n制作人邀请朱雀共进早餐，而朱雀每天必做的训练\n还没完成。于是朱雀一边聊起往事，\n一边完成了剩下的项目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac21e5cc5637be94ea8cbdf2fafedc65b66d7e5c5304f31ec81cf3303e1ca6b",
      "text": "每天早晨的习惯",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:524a05f2da48f512b24ae7b8ef726b03d1df76d0b697879cef3731ab61ea21b0",
      "text": "酒店客房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e3862f94f305624ffaedcb8481b135f9986d35cfe99627d642a6404303312a",
      "text": "这次因为提前一天到了，\n到前往现场之前还有不少充裕时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88f11ad6057c7d124406001c07060cc5e800a83102532352af8acdf728c945bc",
      "text": "到了时间我会来接您。\n在那之前请好好放松休息哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:131700df0f85368a5f21c43398d89e95e984f6b88e26187c25e89552beef7f0f",
      "text": "哦！制作人也是啊！\n我平时可都是起得特别早的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3d6310991aba36dd032d4aa7f68b71ebaf28637ea0a1bd766e8f73d89b0f445",
      "text": "要是有什么事，随时联络我都行！\n那么，明天就请多关照啦！晚安！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000051:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fe18e384802715a65fa18f53722eec3329fab0d7617a9466f3d575d0bb50242",
      "text": "（起太早了。朱雀先生说过他早上起得\n特别早来着……去叫他一起吃早饭吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eae729e2c05a5276cc9a59ab970adaed6c650a7b6b20d7dcb919bafc2df9128",
      "text": "朱雀先生、喵子，\n早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb82dd654d64d8fecf9122d3674b23454084a4ab351d3caf24ac4abd06e72829",
      "text": "早上好啊，●●●●プロデューサー！\n今天也是个舒畅的早晨啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:958db7d8fd5b449225f0fafb84ff92bbca814d9514ba602463ff26cadd750df1",
      "text": "是啊！虽然有点早，不过我是来叫您一起吃早饭的。\n要一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baf44cf15476f24f47c16e6da6f22f7e31d4ef0147f393e0822741f4249874d8",
      "text": "虽然很想说马上就去，\n但在那之前还有事情要做。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aa4db0c39b754d3e51cda1e4afad0cb08daf891d5bbe697d2b8681a67558c40",
      "text": "每天必做的训练还差一点没做完。\n俯卧撑还剩30个，马上就能搞定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:981fbc6b517d39f063668d096a163af629fb30ce7ad431f578f3d431ee0bdf5b",
      "text": "能在屋里等我一下吗？……啊！\n肚子饿了的话你先去也行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45180edf2dfea08d0036b4ce6153e375288b6d524d6965dc14cef96db1ae4a3",
      "text": "谢谢您。我不怎么饿！\n等到您的训练结束吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ff4e1bb261b1a638168e325044d253affeb05fd7d1327f113627bee9aecd29e",
      "text": "说起来啊，可能我还没跟\n●●●●プロデューサー说过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc42c198fb64329fe515fd856f05e52092572c667d0e177013ebf0b3073cde2",
      "text": "请问是什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d932f7cfd277cda9c7eafc981ec9ed8d758e878e83645806a405b64be158274f",
      "text": "就是当职业摔角手的我家父母，\n还没放弃把我培养成职业摔角手的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:248b85c6d7def7721706b2b339d0e07ba42ff7bb4280f86dc82c0cccfe42cca4",
      "text": "尤其是老爹，特别想让我继承他的衣钵啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e5094dc733735ba88461bb040038cacdc7c47f83eee58563e16df9090162c56",
      "text": "“每天早上都要训练锻炼身体。\n要是不做，早饭就没得吃！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb5055bb0963667189ecb0cf2bea4205de5151298cac6fbdff32eba317d9757f",
      "text": "一直被这么念叨呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d4c7bdc00bdd0b9ac620283b832ba8a26bf4eb0fbf604e15d61e6b835837fb4",
      "text": "从小鬼的时候起，每天早上仰卧起坐、背肌训练、俯卧撑\n各做100个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d8b04678c78654278477e793ff6ca8b5f6d85f9b09f14b61f2b4772505538f5",
      "text": "原来如此。\n所以今天早上也一直在训练呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04838d065b8babcf17ef96a7cda24aa5412249cbcc7375a060952554898f3b75",
      "text": "（这份坚持的毅力也是朱雀先生强大的源泉啊！\n这可不是谁都能做到的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4dfc1ca86dcfc1100bb1cdd25f8bb73b60327b34258f6b2dcac1bb261eaa7fa",
      "text": "听了刚才的话可别误会了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dc6004b67495a90a47dc09bf5b531d4c4f75f19ea9eae360c42cf2257a2a9e4",
      "text": "我想用这股力量去不断打倒真正的恶徒，\n作为偶像，而不是被塑造成的反派。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d0ea372f5b036e24ddc1293cb309c779ff871765723fcb3a158d0cf0539ec0",
      "text": "所以我才没有打算去当职业摔角手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0636620b0b807dfab6e47a697042f73beb9cdb5731b0141425370b39c0b2ff0d",
      "text": "不过啊，为了打倒真正的恶徒，\n还是把身体锻炼好比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d0f8ae8fb88278efeade6798f202e6804a78e4f9e8be9905a04379dbfa2fa3d",
      "text": "所以，就算当了偶像，\n我也一天不落坚持着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1cc55f7dd701b478f4822c03f966a120041ab07ab1b5d7c817f744e66692f0",
      "text": "是的！今后也请用狠劲瞪视他们，\n把恶徒们打倒吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d64be082552a40f9a18dc523ff76d43bff3346e3002657b60c9f2c0f9adafe7",
      "text": "除了打倒恶徒之外，我也常觉得\n坚持训练真是太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91e50db24d8dfabce096317bf863f510ed1dffca9d608681db908bd0a7d0dc45",
      "text": "因为在偶像的工作里，\n这份力量经常能派上用场啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:875abf63d968721f0df9148aa49bc9d2d1aba843ab0ad04140119490bcc11326",
      "text": "今天这份工作能拿到邀约，也是因为这个吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37df1445d2240651c18ed331699ae66cb44de0e4219718f46e290c8e38e8cf68",
      "text": "是的，一点也没错！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e7bd82c50b6ddb89885648c8e4364f292652d99ca0d4276a64f87959234ce23",
      "text": "是看到了朱雀先生发挥体力和力量的表现后才发来的邀约呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2337a7a65919a8248600d588c72b6010bc2de4cc9f994d15612a9f43270c960d",
      "text": "自己之前做过的事能引向下一份工作，\n真是一件值得开心的事啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d605b3af54da0c0fba39bcf03928183778934630d272d561a5ec3829e687b72",
      "text": "嘿嘿，今天的工作也要像那时一样\n绝对要大获成功！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "就拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35e8a5c214395024b2fb29cbb9fd61c71d7ae32a96d983a97e2b1e99cde24d1b",
      "text": "今后每天早上的训练我也会继续下去！\n毕竟训练之后的早饭还是最香的啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67448ba35916180764330a3a2fb2302de0f204b51b4d42062c50da1407a8e668",
      "text": "哇哇！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e8d373c9a5ec92b36c991c7c14f31f0e2c411a6b93f7d07efb0f864caec2011",
      "text": "喵子！？怎么了啊突然间！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef036a3c247a6086da595cc6a1d0832fc40afdf34a417db857ebb9e149f3732a",
      "text": "喵喵喵喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a895990dd3d9069d129230e8f4241338516f023602189ef989a816cb993504",
      "text": "叫我快点训练？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c7bf7a3c307fabd4c5f11fbe9b94d38cbbeb1a1f0662f8c0b42ad61eb0d276a",
      "text": "啊，也是啊。让你久等啦对不住！\n喵子也想快点吃饭了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd64ccbb0944f6ff7c055000a8af45f8d8b2d909c8486c05401b759040174913",
      "text": "制作人也是！\n我这就麻溜地把训练搞定！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f711105fe3f1d0bd10c7fafa84f7400d85b2d424d769533b2ebecacb3bf0ad",
      "text": "按照平时的步调来就好哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6e7d10afae7b857bb96b4b63bc0da9019617d0892d363ebbff277c67a4e5010",
      "text": "谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d7f9f3237f3cd0b9ca01c337459bdf937ab9a50700ceb70f6fc3f845946ec77",
      "text": "赶紧把俯卧撑做完吧！\n还剩30个来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6239c18c1d68ae5c99a125dbc24ae3f57cbbcdcc5ec4fb9461134cd74e33ed84",
      "text": "对了！●●●●プロデューサー，\n能拜托你帮我数俯卧撑的次数吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_025suz_01_1_2_025_01:1_2_025_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4698b42b5b3a3549913d2dde3bb512e20d2dc3d2c0c012567aa663f588627623",
      "text": "然后，等做完了我们一起去\n吃顿美味的早饭吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
